    {
      "key": "SiteCountryPanel.013",
      "sourceEnglish": "Country, language, currency and measurement units are separate choices. These details do not select a planting calendar or approve farming advice. They travel with a site if you explicitly share that site.",
      "sourceSha256": "ec245bda69a3fe896eda18af9fdbc765e9dd6d772f5e2a528a84e56aabd1a940",
      "text": "Le pays, la langue, la devise et les unités de mesure constituent des choix distincts. Ces détails ne sélectionnent pas de calendrier de plantation et ne valident aucun conseil agricole. Ils accompagnent un site si vous partagez explicitement ce site.",
      "review": {
        "status": "unreviewed"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "SiteCountryPanel.014",
      "sourceEnglish": "I confirm these details describe this mapped site.",
      "sourceSha256": "0a14498c07908127c4ccef49dd8c1d97df12abadfd089978df63cfd8011e0ea4",
