      "text": "Ouvrir le planificateur de tâches",
      "review": {
        "status": "unreviewed"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "NurseryPlanPanel.007",
      "sourceEnglish": "Nursery checks leave your field-task calendar unchanged. Review the crop plan before changing field dates.",
      "sourceSha256": "c06a580084df97379e8abb822cead7f1d632770c8c75e4b2b0ccd10116aa1e42",
      "text": "Les vérifications de la pépinière ne modifient pas votre calendrier de travaux aux champs. Examinez le plan de culture avant de modifier les dates aux champs.",
      "review": {
        "status": "unreviewed"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "NurseryPlanPanel.008",
      "sourceEnglish": "1. Net nursery growing surface ·",
      "sourceSha256": "c82e1c67f45943651b6d47b96203fd32735433d525913dc038687dbfda4211e0",
      "text": "1. Surface nette de culture en pépinière ·",
      "review": {
        "status": "unreviewed"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "NurseryPlanPanel.009",
      "sourceEnglish": "For this site only. Enter the net surface allocated to these crops after paths, work areas and other uses. Zero means no surface is allocated.",
      "sourceSha256": "b279979dd368754834217480e4e15857f7e319a078659e72de00d1fcfe6d183b",
      "text": "Pour ce site uniquement. Saisissez la surface nette allouée à ces cultures après déduction des allées, des zones de travail et des autres usages. Zéro signifie qu’aucune surface n’est allouée.",
      "review": {
        "status": "unreviewed"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "NurseryPlanPanel.010",
      "sourceEnglish": "m² net allocated",
      "sourceSha256": "7d26411b935d56fcf23751bf7bf6bbce84739729c58ba94425aa9c9e8f0059c4",
      "text": "m² nets alloués",
      "review": {
        "status": "unreviewed"
      }
